<section class="section">
	<div class="section__inner">
		<p>Until recently, I led design across <a href="https://www.totara.com/">Totara</a>'s learning platform. My work spanned UX strategy, design systems, accessibility and the tooling that connects design to code. I moved Totara's design practice to an AI-first way of working.</p>
		<p>I'm now looking for my next design leadership role, and would love to <a href="/contact.html">hear from you</a>.</p>
		<p>Before Totara, I spent more than ten years at <a href="https://www.silverstripe.com/">Silverstripe</a>, leading UX for the open-source CMS and Silverstripe Cloud, and helping build the all-of-government Common Web Platform.</p>
	</div>
</section>

